## Security notes

- Authentication uses `{{{authCredential.header}}}` (model: `{{{authModel}}}`).
- Request bodies are sent as `{{{requestEncoding}}}`.
- Attribution is not required by this provider.
- Provider SDKs are **never** copied into this project. Where an SDK would help,
  declare it as an ordinary dependency instead of vendoring it.
{{#if oauthRequired}}

- Acting on behalf of a seller requires OAuth. The token lifecycle is stubbed
  and documented, not implemented, in this skeleton.
{{/if}}
{{#if webhook.unsigned}}

- **Webhooks are unsigned.** The generated handler cannot verify authenticity.
  It must rely on an allowlist plus a server-side status confirmation before
  fulfilment.
{{/if}}
{{#if webhook.notLocalHmac}}

- Webhook verification is `{{{webhook.verification}}}`, not a local HMAC check.
{{/if}}

