## Reconciliation

Webhooks can be missed: providers retry, but networks and deploy windows are
real. Reconcile against the provider, not against local state.
{{#each operations}}
{{#eq name "status"}}
{{#ne disposition "stub"}}

- `{{{method}}} {{{path}}}` is the authoritative record for a payment. When an
  event is missing or ambiguous, re-fetch by identifier rather than trusting the
  local ledger.
{{/ne}}
{{#eq disposition "stub"}}

- There is no documented status lookup for this provider. Record every accepted
  webhook durably before acknowledging it, and treat the local ledger as the
  source of truth for anything that has not been re-fetched.
{{/eq}}
